**Electronics Prototype Demonstration**

This prototype validates the core electrical system of **SolarFold**, including:
- ☀️ Solar charging
- 🔌 USB Type-C charging
- ⚡ Power management
- 💡 LED lighting

*The foldable enclosure shown in the project renders has not yet been integrated into this prototype.*
